# CODEOWNERS
#
# GitHub uses this file to determine who is requested for review when
# a pull request modifies files matching these patterns.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Patterns are matched in order; the last matching pattern wins.
# Owners are GitHub teams or usernames.
#
# GitHub usernames for each role will be assigned here once the team
# has set up their GitHub accounts and the organisation's GitHub teams.
#
# Teams:
#   @wimmer/engineering         — Technical Lead (Person 5)
#   @wimmer/hospitality-product — Hospitality Lead (Person 1)
